        "group": "第10小节",
        "text": "182. 下列不等式组给出坐标平面上什么样的点的集合？\na) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}y\\geqslant0,\\\\x-y=0;\\end{array}\\right.$\nb) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x\\leqslant0,\\\\x+y=0;\\end{array}\\right.$\nc) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x+y+2\\geqslant0,\\\\x-y=0.\\end{array}\\right.$",
        "figures": []
      },
      {
        "number": "183",
        "source_number": "183",
        "group": "第10小节",
        "text": "183. 作出下列不等式的图象：\na) $xy\\geqslant0$；\nb) $xy\\leqslant0$；\nc) $(x-2)(y-3)\\geqslant0$；\nd) $(x+y)(x-y)\\leqslant0$；\ne) $(x+y)\\left(\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{1}{y}\\right)>0$；\nf) $(x-y)\\left(\\frac{1}{x}-\\frac{1}{y}\\right)>0$。",
        "figures": []
      },
      {
        "number": "184",
        "source_number": "184",
        "group": "第10小节",
        "text": "184. $b$是什么数时，不等式组$\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}y\\leqslant3x+1,\\\\y\\geqslant3x+b\\end{array}\\right.$给出的点的集合是：\na) 带形；\nb) 空集？",
        "figures": []
      },
      {
        "number": "185",
        "source_number": "185",
        "group": "第10小节",
        "text": "185. 画细线条表示由下列不等式组给出的坐标平面上点的集合：\na) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x^2+y^2\\leqslant9,\\\\x^2+y^2\\geqslant1.69;\\end{array}\\right.$\nb) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x^2+y^2\\leqslant36,\\\\|x|>1;\\end{array}\\right.$\nc) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x^2+y^2\\leqslant100,\\\\|x|<8;\\end{array}\\right.$\nd) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x^2+y^2\\leqslant1.44,\\\\xy\\geqslant0;\\end{array}\\right.$\ne) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x^2+y^2\\leqslant100,\\\\x^2+y^2\\geqslant64,\\\\xy\\leqslant0;\\end{array}\\right.$\nf) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}y\\geqslant x^2,\\\\y\\leqslant-x^2+9;\\end{array}\\right.$\ng) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}y\\geqslant x^2+4x+4,\\\\y\\leqslant4;\\end{array}\\right.$\nh) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}y\\geqslant(x-1)^2,\\\\y\\leqslant3.5;\\end{array}\\right.$\ni) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}y\\geqslant(x-2)(x-3),\\\\y\\leqslant0.\\end{array}\\right.$",
        "figures": []
      },
      {
        "number": "186",
        "source_number": "186",
        "group": "第10小节",
        "text": "186. 图27中画细线条表示的平面上点的集合都由不等式组给出。写出这些不等式组。",
        "figures": [
          {
            "id": "fig-27",
            "label": "图 27"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "number": "187",
        "source_number": "187",
        "group": "第10小节",
        "text": "187. 求出由下列不等式组给出的图形$F$的面积：\na) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}y\\geqslant|x|,\\\\y\\leqslant4;\\end{array}\\right.$\nb) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}y\\geqslant|x|,\\\\y\\leqslant0.5x+1.5.\\end{array}\\right.$",
        "figures": []
      }
    ]
